# Test plan: {{ project_name }}

Structured after the test plan in ISO/IEC/IEEE 29119-3, where the test strategy is part
of the plan (section 5). Replace every _(prompt)_ with your own words.

Sections marked **optional** are often more than a take-home needs: delete them unless the
brief asks for them. A two-page plan that is clearly risk-led usually reads better than a
complete one that is not.

## 1. Context of testing

